    "Take the label space to be the cube $F^{\\otimes 3}$ of a space $F$ with a bilinear form in which indicator vectors of neighboring triples are orthogonal; give each gate a label built from the line of its triple and the splitting $A=B\\perp P$, ordered so that only the return of a central wire decreases.",
